10/10 The most impressive and atmospheric game I ever played. Truly epic story and post-apocalyptical environment.
Pros:
- epic story;
- very detailed atmospheric environment;
- great graphical effects;
- great music, sound effects and voice;
- great gameplay; can do action and stealth;
- customizable weapons;
- weapons and equipment feels realistic;
Cons:
- no custom saves, only auto-save; can continue only last auto-save or choose chapters;
- some choice making aren't intuitive; e.g. made a choice to not save Pavel, but wasn't aware that there's a choice at that moment, got bad game ending because of that "choice".
